  <NAME>Homo sapiens</NAME>
  <TITLE>Enhancer activation during EGF response</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>We investigated the acetylation of H3K27, in normal condition and after stimulation of EGF and before or after the depletion of INTS11. Additionally, we examined transcription by sequencing the chromatin-bound fraction of RNA and by fractionating total RNA into polyadenylated and non-polyadenylated compartement. Overall design: Comparison of the genome wide profiles of H3K27ac and RNA in HeLa cells</DESCRIPTION>
